# SPA fallback for the router added in lib/router.ts -- every real URL
# (/food, /garden, /weight, ...) needs to resolve to the same index.html
# and let the client-side router take over from there, or a direct load
# or reload of any URL but "/" 404s on the host instead of opening the app.
#
# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages both read this exact file/format from the
# publish directory. See vercel.json for the equivalent on Vercel -- kept
# both since README's Deployment section hasn't picked a host yet.
/*    /index.html   200
